d it's a world that was left  unfinished by its gods so halfway  through the process they mysteriously  disappear and now we have a world that  has their their tools basically just  kind of littered on the surface and they  do all sorts of crazy things and bizarre  things so it's a super day  planet and it would require actually  someone to be able to have a suit of  powered arm or a javelin to be able to  go out there and explore and experience  everything in the world so these aren't  like earth explorers and this isn't the  far-reaching future this is like a  divergent evolutionary path for some  other type of being I guess yeah that's  right that's right so it's uh it's a  world that's separate from Earth that  there are humans on the planet but they  are not earthlings at that if that makes  sense and living on this incredibly  dangerous world I mean how did they how  did you grow to feel like this is a  place we want to live and colonize and  not be like we want to go to another  planet that's maybe a little bit more  pleasant well there is no there's no  space travel these these people are  indigenous to this planet and so they  have no choice this is this is the lot  that they drew this is where they live  and it is a beautiful lush planet but it  is super dangerous and those dangers are  I think one of the things that are going  to expand the way that players  experience the game and are gonna make  it different every time they go into it  is the way that I understand that right  that's exactly right  it's a very living dynamic world so  every time you go out you will  experiencing something different whether  it's because it's day or night or the  weather's changed but we have a living  breathing ecosystem so you won't always  run into the same creatures at the same  spot every time it'll be it'll be a  little bit different in traversing that  world you you get to fly around which is  obviously a dream of mine to eventually  be able to put on a suit and ju